{"unit_id":"xx529__dsh-terminal-panel#card-zh","repo":"xx529/dsh-terminal-panel","commit":"359aa3cca6379e3cfcf4fdccc0b4579e23632fa5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Terminal Panel 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的终端活动面板。它通过 Host 插件注册本机 RPC 路由，并由浏览器侧面板轮询展示命令行运行记录。面板聚合当前会话、子代理和 Agent Team 队友的 bash、后台任务及持久终端活动，可查看命令、状态和输出，按会话或类型筛选并搜索，展开或收起完成记录、复制命令和输出；对可停止的运行提供停止操作。适合希望在 DSH 会话中集中查看模型命令行活动的用户。需要 DSH 的 webServer 与 connection 服务，不要求额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24","lib/host/panel.mjs:90","lib/client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"xx529__dsh-terminal-panel#card-en","repo":"xx529/dsh-terminal-panel","commit":"359aa3cca6379e3cfcf4fdccc0b4579e23632fa5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Terminal Panel shows bash, background jobs, and terminal runs across the current session, subagents, and teammates. Users can inspect status and output, filter and search, copy output, and stop supported runs. It requires DSH webServer and connection services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24","lib/host/panel.mjs:90","lib/client.js:1"]}
