{"unit_id":"xx529__dsh-terminal-panel#feature-1","repo":"xx529/dsh-terminal-panel","commit":"359aa3cca6379e3cfc4fdccc0b4579e23632fa5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Terminal Panel 的功能「聚合命令行运行」：面板汇总当前会话、子代理和队友的 bash、后台任务及终端活动，并展示各运行记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host/panel.mjs:90"]}
{"unit_id":"xx529__dsh-terminal-panel#feature-2","repo":"xx529/dsh-terminal-panel","commit":"359aa3cca6379e3cfc4fdccc0b4579e23632fa5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Terminal Panel 的功能「查看输出」：用户可在运行卡片中查看命令行任务的输出和状态，并跟随新输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:20"]}
{"unit_id":"xx529__dsh-terminal-panel#feature-3","repo":"xx529/dsh-terminal-panel","commit":"359aa3cca6379e3cfc4fdccc0b4579e23632fa5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Terminal Panel 的功能「筛选和搜索」：用户可按会话或活动类型过滤运行记录，也可搜索命令或输出文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:20"]}
{"unit_id":"xx529__dsh-terminal-panel#feature-4","repo":"xx529/dsh-terminal-panel","commit":"359aa3cca6379e3cfc4fdccc0b4579e23632fa5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Terminal Panel 的功能「停止运行」：运行卡片提供停止操作；仅支持可停止的运行来源，终态输出来源不提供面板停止能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host/panel.mjs:90"]}
{"unit_id":"xx529__dsh-terminal-panel#caveat-1","repo":"xx529/dsh-terminal-panel","commit":"359aa3cca6379e3cfc4fdccc0b4579e23632fa5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Terminal Panel 使用 DSH 的 webServer 和 connection 服务注册 Host RPC 路由；未注入这些服务时插件会报错，无法提供面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24","lib/index.js:44"]}
